#: userland/apps/calc/actions.cpp:311
msgid "<p><b>Standard and scientific</b><br>Use + - * / ^, parentheses, postfix % and !. 200*10% = 20. ans is the last answer, mem is memory. Powers associate right to left; -2^2 = -4. Use explicit multiplication: 2*pi.</p><p>Functions: sin, cos, tan, asin, acos, atan, sinh, cosh, tanh, sqrt, cbrt, ln, log, exp, abs, floor, ceil, round; pow(a,b), min(a,b), max(a,b), hypot(a,b), mod(a,b), atan2(y,x). Choose degrees or radians.</p><p><b>Programmer</b><br>Integer DEC/HEX/OCT/BIN, 8/16/32/64 bits. Prefixes: 0d, 0x, 0o, 0b. Operators: + - * / %, AND OR XOR NOT, &amp; | ^ ~, &lt;&lt; &gt;&gt;; rol(value,count), ror(value,count). Arithmetic wraps to the word width. Signed mode uses two's complement, signed division and arithmetic right shift. Shift counts must be smaller than the width. Calculated values keep their bit pattern when the base changes.</p><p><b>Conversions</b><br>Choose units and enter a value or expression. Preview is automatic; Convert adds history. Temperatures below absolute zero are rejected. MB is decimal, MiB is binary. US and UK volumes are distinct.</p><p><b>Statistics and dates</b><br>Up to 1024 finite numbers; sample variance requires two. Dates use the Gregorian calendar (0001 to 9999). Differences exclude the end date. Weekdays exclude Saturday and Sunday, without holidays. Add days uses whole calendar days.</p><p>Ctrl+1..6 switches mode. Enter calculates; Ctrl+Enter calculates statistics. Esc clears input. Ctrl+Shift+C copies the result. Double-click history to reuse an expression (other modes copy the result). Memory and history last for this session.</p>"
msgstr "<p><b>标准与科学模式</b><br>支持 + - * / ^、括号、后缀百分号 % 和阶乘 !。200*10% = 20。ans 为上次结果，mem 为内存值。乘方从右向左结合；-2^2 = -4。乘法必须显式输入，如 2*pi。</p><p>函数：sin、cos、tan、asin、acos、atan、sinh、cosh、tanh、sqrt、cbrt、ln、log、exp、abs、floor、ceil、round；双参数函数 pow(a,b)、min(a,b)、max(a,b)、hypot(a,b)、mod(a,b)、atan2(y,x)。三角函数可选角度或弧度。</p><p><b>程序员模式</b><br>支持二、八、十、十六进制与 8/16/32/64 位整数。前缀 0d、0x、0o、0b 可指定字面量进制。运算：+ - * / %、AND OR XOR NOT、&amp; | ^ ~、&lt;&lt; &gt;&gt;，以及 rol(值,位数)、ror(值,位数)。算术结果按位宽截断。有符号模式使用补码、有符号除法和算术右移。移位数必须小于字长。已计算结果在切换进制后保留位模式。</p><p><b>单位换算</b><br>选择单位后输入数值或表达式即可实时预览；点击换算将结果加入历史。温度不能低于绝对零度。MB 为十进制，MiB 为二进制，英美制容量单位分开列出。</p><p><b>统计与日期</b><br>最多输入 1024 个有限数值，样本方差需要至少两个数。日期使用公历，支持 0001 至 9999 年；日期差不含结束日期，工作日仅排除周六日，不考虑节假日。增加天数按整日计算。</p><p>Ctrl+1..6 切换模式；Enter 计算，统计输入区用 Ctrl+Enter 计算；Esc 清空输入；Ctrl+Shift+C 复制结果。双击历史可恢复表达式，其他模式复制记录结果。内存与历史仅在本次运行中保留。</p>"

